{
  "$comment": [
    "Reviewed baseline for scripts/i18n.py check: values that are legitimately identical",
    "to the English default in that locale, so they are not reported as untranslated.",
    "",
    "Only three kinds of value belong here:",
    "  1. cognates that are correct as-is (German 'Host', French 'Document', Dutch 'Filters');",
    "  2. language endonyms that are the same word everywhere (Hindi, Urdu, Filipino);",
    "  3. format-only strings ('%1$d min', 'OK (%1$ds)', '[Emoji]').",
    "Adding a real translation gap here silently hides it, so prefer translating over listing.",
    "Regenerate with: python scripts/i18n.py check --json   (warnings where category==leftover)"
  ],
  "allow": {
    "zh-rCN": [
      "%1$s · SHA-256 %2$s"
    ],
